0 gears-idler-24-24-24 (Brickwright Robot Lab validation machine)
0 Name: gears-idler-24-24-24.ldr
0 Author: Brickwright
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Idler train 24:24:24 (Robot Lab validation, test/bw-sim-validation.test.mjs).
0 // Bench: a SPIKE medium motor (port A) stands output-up at the origin (LDraw, -y up); a beam lies under
0 // its housing, pinned into the housing's bottom holes u0/u1 (x = +-20) by two friction pins, so beam and
0 // housing are one rigid frame. The motor's output carries a 3L axle (y -90..-30). Driven gears ride 8L axles
0 // that turn in the frame beam's round holes and pass the housing's side (x >= 34). Pitch radii (module 1,
0 // 1 mm = 2.5 LDU): 8T 10, 24T 30, 40T 50 LDU, so meshing centres are hole multiples of 20 LDU.
0 // Beam 9 frame centred at x = 60 (holes -20..140). 24T on the motor; idler 24T at x = 60; output 24T at
0 // x = 120 (centres 30 + 30 = 60). The idler turns -1 with the motor, the output +1: an idler changes the
0 // direction, never the ratio.
0 !BW ID motor
0 !BW PORT A
1 71 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 54696p01.dat
0 !BW ID frame
1 72 60 40 0 0 0 1 0 1 0 -1 0 0 40490.dat
0 !BW ID framePin1
1 0 20 30 0 0 1 0 1 0 0 0 0 -1 2780.dat
0 !BW ID framePin2
1 0 -20 30 0 0 1 0 1 0 0 0 0 -1 2780.dat
0 !BW ID axleIn
1 4 0 -60 0 0 1 0 1 0 0 0 0 -1 4519.dat
0 !BW ID gIn
1 16 0 -60 0 1 0 0 0 0 1 0 -1 0 3648.dat
0 !BW ID axleIdler
1 4 60 -10 0 0 1 0 1 0 0 0 0 -1 3707.dat
0 !BW ID gIdler
1 16 60 -60 0 1 0 0 0 0 1 0 -1 0 3648.dat
0 !BW ID axleOut
1 4 120 -10 0 0 1 0 1 0 0 0 0 -1 3707.dat
0 !BW ID gOut
1 16 120 -60 0 1 0 0 0 0 1 0 -1 0 3648.dat
